# Vertis Global

> Vertis Global delivers technology projects, managed services, and staffing. One team across the full tech lifecycle. Founded 2012. Teams across the US, EMEA, and APAC. 2023 Diversity Supplier of the Year.

## What we do

- **Projects**. Fixed scope builds. Data & Analytics, AI & Automation, Cloud Modernization, Salesforce, SAP/S4HANA, RPA, Business Transformation. {{ site.url }}/services/
- **Managed Services**. SLA-backed day-two operations. Cloud Operations + FinOps, Data Platform Operations, Application Support, Security Operations, MLOps. {{ site.url }}/managed-services/
- **Staffing**. Specialist talent. Staff Augmentation, Fractional Tech Leadership, Dedicated Squads, Training and Enablement. {{ site.url }}/staffing/

## Flagship industry

Transportation and Logistics. Telematics consolidation, dispatch intelligence, route optimization, fleet cloud FinOps. {{ site.url }}/industries/transportation-logistics/

## How we engage

Four steps on every engagement. Scope. Plan. Build. Handover. Fixed scope on projects. Monthly retainer on managed services. 2 to 3 week placements on staffing. {{ site.url }}/approach/

